(7692684, 1261014, 143116, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but a bit dark to my liking. This must have been a few hours before sunset, but it looks like night. Top 3.</td>', 'Good shot, but a bit dark to my liking. This must have been a few hours before sunset, but it looks like night. Top 3.', '2021-04-27 11:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
