(7692699, 1260971, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Although I love this (and it will probably ribbon), it looks like a starburst filter was used on the camera.   The rules say "Create a starburst (not simple lens flare) effect by controlling your exposure settings" and I think there was a discussion about whether a physical star filter would be accomplishing the challenge topic.  <br/> <br/>Anyway, as I said, it will probably ribbon, so don''t worry!  LOL    I was just giving you a "heads up" in case you get a few very low votes.<br/> <br/>I am not voting on it.</td>', 'Hmmm... Although I love this (and it will probably ribbon), it looks like a starburst filter was used on the camera.   The rules say "Create a starburst (not simple lens flare) effect by controlling your exposure settings" and I think there was a discussion about whether a physical star filter would be accomplishing the challenge topic.   Anyway, as I said, it will probably ribbon, so don''t worry!  LOL    I was just giving you a "heads up" in case you get a few very low votes. I am not voting on it.', '2021-04-27 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
