(7693237, 1261022, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting starburst, artfully deployed and integrated into the overall image.  Fine, moody atmosphere.</td>', 'Interesting starburst, artfully deployed and integrated into the overall image.  Fine, moody atmosphere.', '2021-05-02 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693238, 1261008, 173844, '<td valign="top">Love the sprawling roots that lead to the upright trunks, a chalice for the starburst. Too bad about the arrow.</td>', 'Love the sprawling roots that lead to the upright trunks, a chalice for the starburst. Too bad about the arrow.', '2021-05-02 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693239, 1260971, 143116, '<td valign="top">Great shot, my pick for the blue. I love the many starbursts!<br/>Must have been a pretty long exposure time, with a smooth sea, and the trail of a flashing airplane at the right.</td>', 'Great shot, my pick for the blue. I love the many starbursts!Must have been a pretty long exposure time, with a smooth sea, and the trail of a flashing airplane at the right.', '2021-05-02 23:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693240, 1260971, 173844, '<td valign="top">The best starbursts of the challenge.  Sleek, bejeweled in the night.</td>', 'The best starbursts of the challenge.  Sleek, bejeweled in the night.', '2021-05-02 23:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693241, 1260684, 173844, '<td valign="top">Love the backlighting of the daffodils.  The interplay of tones is fascinating.  The subtle starburst is very pleasing.</td>', 'Love the backlighting of the daffodils.  The interplay of tones is fascinating.  The subtle starburst is very pleasing.', '2021-05-02 23:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693242, 1261004, 143116, '<td valign="top">There were a couple of starburst in the sun, and some at night. Personally, I think the effect at night is more appealing; the daylight shots tend to be a bit dark (an artificial night) which defeats the purpose.<br/>But I do like how the dandelion is lit and radiates, like a million starbursts by itself.</td>', 'There were a couple of starburst in the sun, and some at night. Personally, I think the effect at night is more appealing; the daylight shots tend to be a bit dark (an artificial night) which defeats the purpose.But I do like how the dandelion is lit and radiates, like a million starbursts by itself.', '2021-05-02 23:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693243, 1260913, 143116, '<td valign="top">Definitely a good sunburst, with the sun partially hidden to create the desired effect. I like the fence, and how it is lit. But the bottom right as it stands lacks interest. I''m curious how the picture would look with the sunburst and the fence closer together as the main elements in the picture.</td>', 'Definitely a good sunburst, with the sun partially hidden to create the desired effect. I like the fence, and how it is lit. But the bottom right as it stands lacks interest. I''m curious how the picture would look with the sunburst and the fence closer together as the main elements in the picture.', '2021-05-02 23:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
